{"type":"message","id":"a013a1a1","parentId":"466c5a4a","timestamp":"2026-05-04T05:21:52.234Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-05-04 05:21 UTC] Generate a feature image for this article. Title: Bitcoin Surge Sparks Market Rally. Topic: Bitcoin Surge. Key Facts: 1) Bitcoin broke 5,000 resistance, 2) Institutional interest and regulatory optimism driving rally. Crypto Asset: Bitcoin. Use the Scene Formula in your SOUL.md to pick the right human subject and scene, then run the API calls and logo stamp steps exactly as defined in your SOUL.md."}],"timestamp":1777872112230}}
{"type":"message","id":"baf0f16d","parentId":"a013a1a1","timestamp":"2026-05-04T05:22:05.826Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User wants to generate feature image per SOUL instructions. Need to follow steps: craft prompt using formula. Need human subject: price movement scenario: \"Trader at multi-monitor desk, Bitcoin price chart on screen\". Include human subject, Bitcoin asset visible, editorial style. Must be under 300 chars.\n\nLet's craft prompt: \"Focused male trader at multi-screen trading desk, Bitcoin price chart soaring on a monitor, bright office background, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\"\n\nCheck characters count. Count roughly: each word + spaces. Let's count: \"Focused\"(7) space1 =8, \"male\"(4)=12, space=13, \"trader\"(6)=19, space=20, \"at\"(2)=22, space=23, \"multi-screen\"(11)=34, space=35, \"trading\"(7)=42, space=43, \"desk,\"(5)=48, space=49, \"Bitcoin\"(7)=56, space=57, \"price\"(5)=62, space=63, \"chart\"(5)=68, space=69, \"soaring\"(7)=76, space=77, \"on\"(2)=79, space=80, \"a\"(1)=81, space=82, \"monitor,\"(8)=90, space=91, \"bright\"(6)=97, space=98, \"office\"(6)=104, space=105, \"background,\"(11)=116, space=117, \"editorial\"(9)=126, space=127, \"press\"(5)=132, space=133, \"photography,\"(12)=145, space=146, \"Reuters\"(7)=153, space=154, \"style,\"(6)=160, space=161, \"photorealistic,\"(15)=176, space=177, \"DSLR,\"(5)=182, space=183, \"35mm\"(4)=187, space=188, \"lens,\"(5)=193, space=194, \"sharp\"(5)=199, space=200, \"focus,\"(6)=206, space=207, \"candid\"(6)=213. Under 300, fine.\n\nNow need to call Leonardo API via curl. Use exec tool. Need to parse generationId. Then poll up to 3 times.\n\nWe need to store responses. We'll exec curl and capture output; we need to parse JSON. Use jq? Not sure if jq installed. Could use grep/awk. Simpler: use python -c to parse. But easier: capture generationId using shell tools like sed.\n\nLet's do: exec curl POST ... -d '{\"prompt\":\"...\"}' and pipe to jq -r '.generations[0].id' maybe structure unknown. The API spec maybe returns { generationId: \"...\"}. We'll inspect after call.\n\nWe'll run exec with command that outputs generationId to variable? But can't store variable across calls. We'll need to capture output via exec and read in next step. The exec tool returns result in response; we can parse manually.\n\nLet's run exec and capture output.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-7ca400d9f7544204b96bd4305966c2a0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl --silent --request POST --url https://cloud.leonardo.ai/api/rest/v1/generations --header 'accept: application/json' --header 'authorization: Bearer dddd08ff-d8c3-4fec-98d9-9e8c060f4619' --header 'content-type: application/json' --data '{\"prompt\": \"Focused male trader at multi-screen trading desk, Bitcoin price chart soaring on a monitor, bright office background, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\", \"modelId\": \"b2614463-296c-462a-9586-aafdb8f00e36\", \"num_images\": 1, \"width\": 1024, \"height\": 576}'","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"openai/gpt-oss-120b","usage":{"input":10366,"output":853,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11219,"cost":{"input":0.000404274,"output":0.00016207,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.000566344}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777872112237,"responseId":"gen-1777872113-kxuRigMxoekoUEFChUJI"}}
